<p id="A5.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Video-MME:</span> <a href="https://github.com/MME-Benchmarks/Video-MME" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Video-MME</a></p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MMVU:</span> <a href="https://github.com/yale-nlp/MMVU.git" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">MMVU</a></p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LongVideoBench:</span> <a href="https://github.com/longvideobench/LongVideoBench" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Artifact Usage</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The use of existing artifacts is consistent with their intended use in We will make our code and models publicly accessible and all created artifacts will be only for research purposes and should not be used outside of research contexts.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section><div class="ltx_rdf" about="" property="dcterms:title" content="Overleaf Example"></div>

